        "id": 1,
        "options": {
          "content": "## Combined Health Intelligence \u2014 Data Fusion Logic\n\n| Metric | Primary Source | Fallback | Rationale |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **Readiness Score** | **CoachReadiness** (personal 30d baseline) | WHOOP Recovery | CoachReadiness uses your personal HRV baseline \u2014 unaffected by WHOOP's age-based 7-day reset. Critical for atenolol athletes. |\n| **HRV** | Garmin overnight (5-min window) | WHOOP rMSSD (non-REM) | Both valid, different methodology \u2014 Garmin typically 5\u201315ms higher. Use trend, not absolute. |\n| **Resting HR** | Garmin daily minimum | WHOOP sleep average | Garmin RHR is lower (overnight min). WHOOP 5\u201310 bpm higher (sleep average). Both directionally consistent. |\n| **Sleep Score** | Garmin + WHOOP | \u2014 | Garmin and WHOOP diverge on scoring algorithm. Show both, watch trends. |\n| **SpO2** | Garmin (daytime avg) | WHOOP (sleep) | Garmin captures waking state |\n| **Training Load** | DerivedActivity (fenix 8 only) | TrainingLoadDaily | TrainingLoadDaily has device pollution \u2014 use DerivedActivity filtered by device for accuracy. |\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f **WHOOP Recovery score resets to age-based norms every ~7 days. Use CoachReadiness as the authoritative readiness signal.**\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f **Tactix 7 PRO / Index Smart Scale phantom data:** pipeline writes all activities to all device tags. All queries here filter to fenix 8 only.",
          "mode": "markdown"
        },
        "title": "\ud83d\udccb Data Source Guide",
        "type": "text"
      },
